Package: lapidary
Title: Data Wrangling, Analysis and Styled Visualisation of German Groundwater-Level Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Max", "Nölscher", , "trashmail.mn@posteo.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to ingest, normalise and analyse groundwater-level time
    series for Germany (starting with the GEMS-GER benchmark dataset) and to
    produce a shared, poster- and web-ready ggplot2 style scheme. The package
    owns the data model, caching layer, analysis primitives (reference
    periods, water years, per-well summaries, normalisation, trends, spatial
    hexagon aggregation) and, from a later milestone, reusable plot builders.
    Downstream packages (a Shiny website, a poster builder) consume lapidary.
